42:33.679 --> 42:36.820
Saya tak pucat. Saya cuma penat.

42:37.650 --> 42:38.949
Awak narsisistik. Pergi dulu.

42:40.219 --> 42:41.289
Hei.

42:45.690 --> 42:47.059
